    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "01 Hypothesis",
      "effectivePt": 38
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "01",
      "effectivePt": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "Research question",
      "effectivePt": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "Can a page-traceable Legal RAG pipeline balance answer quality, grounding, valid output, and latency?",
      "effectivePt": 30
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "02 Methodology",
      "effectivePt": 38
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "02",
      "effectivePt": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "03 Results",
      "effectivePt": 38
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "03",
      "effectivePt": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "Strong answers, multiplicative bottlenecks",
      "effectivePt": 31
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "End-to-end benchmark profile · all 100 answers",
      "effectivePt": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "Do not merge the two grounding views: benchmark grounding is 0.847 on 100 answers; macro page Fβ is 0.892 on 95 annotated questions.",
      "effectivePt": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "Attribution removes excess pages without complete misses",
      "effectivePt": 31
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "Sequential states of the same 95 annotated answers",
      "effectivePt": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "H2 is supported in its primary effects. Recall fell 1.6 pp; Fβ rose 1.5 pp, but its paired interval spans zero (-0.3 to +3.1 pp).",
      "effectivePt": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "Narrowing helps local evidence, hurts distributed evidence",
      "effectivePt": 31
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "Final attribution minus raw retrieval · macro Fβ",
      "effectivePt": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "Distributed support is the failure boundary: the selector becomes too aggressive when evidence spans pages or documents.",
      "effectivePt": 27
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "Exploratory split, not a pre-registered causal test. The pipeline stages are architecture, not a component ablation.",
      "effectivePt": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "Decision",
      "effectivePt": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "Retrieve broadly. Attribute explicitly. Narrow conservatively when support spans pages or documents.",
      "effectivePt": 32
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "Sequential states of the same answers - not three independent systems.",
      "effectivePt": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "Limitations",
      "effectivePt": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "One saved run; no repeated seeds or end-to-end uncertainty estimate.",
      "effectivePt": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "Retrospective thresholds; no full component ablation or independent baseline.",
      "effectivePt": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "One DIFC corpus; TTFT only; OCR fallback was not separately exercised.",
      "effectivePt": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "html",
      "text": "References [1] Lewis et al., NeurIPS 2020. [2] Karpukhin et al., EMNLP 2020. [3] Cormack et al., SIGIR 2009. [4] Gao et al., EMNLP 2023. [5] Pipitone & Alami, LegalBench-RAG 2024. [6] Zhang et al., Qwen3 Embedding 2025.",
